00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.980
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.360
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.900
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.240
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:20.240
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:26.830
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>utsukushii tsurugi wa hito to hito tsunagete</i>

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:34.840
<b>People are connected by beautiful, double-edged swords</b>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>meguri kuru setsuna sa kanashimi wo aratte</i>

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:44.770
<b>Our coming anticipation will wash away our sadness</b>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<i>anata to no aida ni inochi aru katachi wo</i>

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>With you, between us, life is formed</b>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<i>Kono hoshi ni sasageru ai to iu shirushi de</i>

00:00:53.780 --> 00:01:05.120
<b>With the proof called "love" that we offer to this planet</b>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:06.080
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.580
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.580
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.210
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.590
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:27.440
<i>To see such a sunrise in the middle of the night is quite terrifying.</i>

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:32.940
<i>It's similar to the sunrise one sees while on the moon, and yet it's also very different.</i>

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:39.160
<i>The shuddering ground and air causes our souls to tremble in fear.</i>

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.950
<i>Lost Mountain...</i>

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.750
<i>...the place where the blackest mark of the Dark History was left on the earth.</i>

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:57.760
<b>Entrusted Things</b>

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.850
It's seven or eight kilometers at its deepest point...

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.350
And about 50 kilometers in diameter.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.770
That's the most accurate data that the White Doll's sensors can pick up...

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.770
But I can't say it's 100% accurate.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.350
Loran, do we really have to stay inside our cockpits?

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.640
You can't leave them!

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:47.850
Why is that?

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.980
Frankly, you shouldn't even have the hatch open at all.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:54.360
The Kapool itself should have enough shielding to protect you, though.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.360
Gavane was somewhere within this carter...

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.650
By protection, do you mean from the poison?

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:03.660
That's right, it should protect you from radiation poisoning.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.370
Is the air poisoned?

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.160
I've already explained it to you.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.080
Well, that's true...

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:12.750
But I don't really understand all of your talk about half lives, energy, radiation and contamination.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:18.550
Even after the explosion, the poison will spread around this area for quite some time, right?

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:20.760
Unfortunately, it will.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:25.470
It will remain in this condition... for what seems to be nearly an eternity.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:29.480
Nothing will be able to live here.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:31.980
An eternity?

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.150
That's correct.

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:36.860
Lady Sochie, we must go to the Soleil.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.570
The Soleil?
- Why?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.250
So there was such a legendary weapon hidden on the Earth.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.380
This fact will significantly change the face of this war.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.040
From my perspective, this could be beneficial.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.760
Those probably weren't the only hidden Nuclear Weapons that were discovered.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.050
Regardless of all else, I will claim them...

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.760
And use them to alter the situation for my own sake.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:06.680
Commander?

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.060
Go and meet with the Zenoa Team and retrieve the remaining Nuclear Weapons.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.640
I'll accept that as an order.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.560
There's quite a bit of truth to your words.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.560
Once we have claimed those weapons...

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.560
...our situation will completely change.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:18.940
It will be totally different.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:34.250
How could all of this damage have been caused by one type of bomb...

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.540
Lieutenant, are you all right?

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.750
Is that you, Leia? And everyone else?

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.550
I'm not getting any responses from them.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.670
That must mean...

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:47.340
...the only ones who survived were my own unit, and Leia...

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.260
Minos, we have to move!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.560
Yes, Sir!

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.980
You can't keep wearing that space suit forever.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:14.250
Hey John, isn't this where Commander Gavane's unit should be?

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.880
It should be down there, we fled twenty or thirty kilometers from where he was.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.750
You mean he'd be somewhere beyond this ridge, right?

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.760
I had no idea a bomb like this existed!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.840
It seems large enough to destroy the area of about two or three cities.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:34.140
Well, that's just the way it is.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.140
We can only blame ourselves.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.360
It can't be true.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.950
I don't see any other survivors in this area.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.450
Apparently.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.870
What happened to Minos?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.540
He took off his space suit and went off on his own for a bit.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.870
Did he?

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:02.880
By the way, Lieutenant Zenoa, what exactly are you carrying?

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:04.170
What do you...

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.470
I had forgotten.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.350
I brought two of the nuclear warheads with me!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.350
Is that a problem?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.640
Of course it's a problem!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.480
Lieutenant Zenoa!

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:21.860
Lieutenant!

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.770
What?

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.150
It's the enemy's Mobile Suits!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.280
So there were a few survivors.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.950
Leia, follow me, we'll leave here.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.670
Lieutenant, what do you think you're doing?

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.670
You shouldn't be carrying around Nuclear weapons like these with you!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.840
l couldn't leave them behind and allow them to fall into enemy hands!

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:59.140
Two WaDs?

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.360
Are those the WaDs from the Zenoa Team?

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.440
Just who I was looking for!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.450
I, Lieutenant Poe, am here under Commander Phil's orders.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:10.860
Who is this?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.870
They're not from the Royal Guard?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.450
The Lieutenant is carrying the atomic weapons.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.240
Leia, don't tell her that!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:19.080
You still have them?

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.670
I'll take those for Commander Phil.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:26.550
But nuclear weapons have never been used before in the entire Moonrace's history!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:31.470
If we use these, we'll be able to force the Militia to quit resisting us. Hand them over, now!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:35.470
So you want to use these to advance your position? Then find some of your own!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.850
You won't get these warheads from me!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.850
Captain, what are you talking about?

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.560
I won't go along with you!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:45.650
We have to take them to the Soleil ourselves before the enemy finds and attacks us.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.940
What gives you the authority to make such decisions!?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.570
Halt!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.450
You must stop this!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.740
Don't interfere!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.750
That thing is a real nuclear weapon!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.160
We need it because it's a real nuclear weapon, don't we?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.460
Isn't that the point?

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:05.880
Obtaining them by force could set them off!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.460
I'll take that chance!

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.670
Get off!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.680
There is no way that I'll give this up!

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.260
I've seen more than enough nuclear blasts today!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.150
Lieutenant, please don't be so stubborn!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.070
Are you insane?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.780
Quit being such a damn pest!

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.160
If those bomb were to detonate, we'd all be killed!

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.870
How could you just fire your beam rifle at them so carelessly?

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:43.580
I was too reckless...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.670
Please, just slow down and consider what's on the Lieutenant's mind.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:51.880
That's...

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.550
I don't remember causing any damage.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.350
Yeah, I know.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.260
Can you make it move?

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.470
Just leave it to me.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:02.140
There.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:02.980
It's working?

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.140
It'll need a full overhaul.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.560
That sounds about right.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.770
Enemy sighting?

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:09.860
It's only a mini-doll.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.440
Cease-fire!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:12.940
I can handle it.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:14.860
Milady, you mustn't.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.360
What is it holding?

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:19.660
I need to speak with each of you!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.160
What kind of thing is that mini-doll holding?

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.660
It looks like a bomb!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.080
That's what it is!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.370
You mustn't attack!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:29.380
These bombs are the very same ones which you saw go off last night!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.460
Then don't bring them over here, get away from us!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.960
Please, take these and run!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:34.970
Why should we?

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.840
Please, take these and get away from here!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.760
Run away? Where?

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.260
We're your enemies!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.140
This bomb doesn't care who its friends or foes are!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.640
I'll stop the people who are chasing after them.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.560
It's coming!

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.560
Is that a SUMO?

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.480
Loran!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.570
We have to do something to help, Milady, Miashei!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.740
Why would I find the Mustache here?

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.370
They're approaching me without weapons?

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.040
Do you really want me to attack you?

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.540
Well, here I go!

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.050
Why aren't you dodging? Aren't you carrying a pilot?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.340
- Give me water...
- ...Water!

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.180
Could these enemies be more than simple Militia pilots!?

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.640
Commander Phil!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.440
Loran, your battle plan was idiotic!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.070
That could have ended very badly.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.570
What if they had attacked us directly!?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:41.950
It's a real phenomenon.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:45.950
They say that when people are dying from radiation poisoning, the only thing they want is water.

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.880
Did that do it?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.880
After witnessing that explosion...

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.760
I'm willing to do whatever is necessary to help Queen Dianna ensure that this war finally ends.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.470
That's just what I would expect from the person with whom such items may be entrusted too.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.640
Entrusted?

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:08.770
Allow me to enlist in the cause you just declared.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.140
You mean my appeal?

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:11.850
That's right.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:16.360
Take these and head for the mountains, or the sea... no, head for the mountains.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.070
What if you're court martialed for doing this?

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:19.780
Whatever comes will come.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:23.660
I don't want to see my own men die in vain.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:26.580
I'm counting on you, Mr. Militia ace pilot.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.450
But...

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.460
My name is Ralpha Zenoa.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:32.170
After seeing the capability of nuclear weapons firsthand...

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.750
...I've become a soldier who's lost his will to continue fighting.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:43.680
Loran, should I go?

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:44.550
Go where?

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:45.550
Milady?

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.140
That man, you're worried about letting him go alone, aren't you?

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.060
That is true, but...

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.560
We'd be an easy target if we all went as a group anyhow.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.480
But Sochie, that Lieutenant...

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:58.440
And besides, that appeal to Queen Dianna must be made no matter what.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.780
Loran, can you handle the weapons on your own?

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:01.950
I'll be fine.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.050
I'm dead if these explode...

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.780
That should be alright.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:55.330
Why would they call this thing "Muttowoo"? That's such a weird name!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.540
Commander Phil decided it.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.630
Muttowoo... It's still weird.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:17.850
So what you're saying is that you'd like for me to relinquish my power?

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:20.650
You saw the explosion last night.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:22.150
That's correct, I saw it.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:26.660
Something of such a scale could only have been caused by a nuclear weapon.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:30.530
That is something which Dianna Counter has never directly possessed.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.250
Therefore, it could only have been excavated from Lost Mountain.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.040
A Nuclear weapon?

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:39.040
As long as our hands are tied by such taboos, we may never be able to properly deal with this.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:43.960
If the Militia gains them, we can't guarantee they'll hold back. While we could use nuclear weapons to destroy the Militia,

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:46.260
Our taboo prevents us from wielding them.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:50.260
Queen Dianna's weak diplomatic policies are no longer needed.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:54.430
Yet the Moonrace's very existence, and the fact that the earth has been restored...

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.940
...Are because we have banned the use of such things.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:01.520
And now, you wish to regress to the time of mankind's forgotten sins.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:06.110
Whether it's the Terrans who oppose us, or the terrorists within our own ranks,

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.740
you've been too weak to oppose them.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:12.330
Given this opportunity, what position do you wish to obtain for yourself?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:16.750
What I want is the power to completely remove anyone on this planet who opposes our right to live here.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.330
We'll then force these barbarians to do hard labor, if necessary.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:23.250
The Moonrace will rule over the Terrans as if it was our second nation.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.130
Our second nation?

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.920
If you do that, the war will become even bloodier than it is now.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:31.140
The earth's resistance is what has cost us so much...

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.050
And so that's the position we're in now.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:36.060
If it's your true desire for all of us to return to the earth...

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.060
Then, we must hurry and do what is needed to make that a reality!

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.560
Your hesitant and indecision will not get us anywhere!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.150
This power cannot be granted to you.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.860
Do you speak for everyone?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.360
Treating the earth as the moon's vassal nation? Nonsense.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.660
That approach will only cause history to repeat.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.820
If you dare suggest this again...

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.830
Ambassador Miran, Commander Phil would be executed.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.660
You would have this man executed?

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.040
Execution...

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.120
That is Dianna's strength.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.960
Had it been myself, I would've been forced to give in.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.550
- It's the enemy!
- It's also Lieutenant Zenoa!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:13.850
Lieutenant Zenoa, I'll fire if you come any closer!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.430
Let us through!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:20.560
Did you take these people captive? If you wish to make it through here alive, you must drop all your weapons!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:23.360
It'll all become clear once you let us all through!

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.520
I'm no captive!

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:30.030
I believe that Queen Dianna's suggestion about stalling for time is correct.

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:39.750
Ambassador Miran, if we take any more time, the earth will be seized by Agrippa's faction, who only wishes to stay on the moon!

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.120
What is it?

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.960
Lieutenant Zenoa has brought back enemy units?

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.340
What is this?

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.550
He said that he wishes to meet with Her Majesty.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.050
What are you doing here, Earth mobile suits!?

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.640
I am only here to negotiate.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:58.930
Please hear us out!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.640
Then leave your weapons!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.060
I can't do that!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.060
Wait!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.730
You damn ignorant fools!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:09.940
Come on!

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.360
Stop this!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:15.030
They didn't come here to fight you!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:17.530
These Moonrace morons don't understand anything!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.660
Lady...

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.330
All of you, clear out!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.250
Yesterday's explosion was a nuclear blast!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:27.630
It was powerful enough to destroy an entire mountain or a city in a single blow!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.960
This isn't the time to be squabbling over something so petty!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.130
You fools!

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.050
Isn't that Sochie!?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.260
Stop this now!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:43.140
Sochie?

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.560
Miss Kihel!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.560
Lieutenant Harry?

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.060
Don't ask any questions and follow me.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:48.730
Yes.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.150
Hold it, please.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.450
What is this?

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:58.160
As I told you, my wish was to see you relinquish your position in the stage's center to me.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.040
Queen Dianna, now, before it's too late!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:02.540
Miss Dianna, run!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:04.660
Thank you!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.250
Leave her.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.250
Commander?

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:11.550
I'm already aware of the game you're trying to play. Now go back to your room.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.340
Queen Dianna's departing.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.430
And you, Lieutenant Harry?

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.550
I am tasked with the protection of Queen Dianna.

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.260
I wish to stay in contact with Lieutenant Harry.

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:23.640
Yes Ma'am. You can use my personal computer.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:24.930
Thank you.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.240
Hopefully, this confuses Commander Phil... but...

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:41.950
Mr. Zenoa!

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:43.160
Are you alright?

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:46.460
I won't allow them to attack the ladies again.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.750
Now all of you, listen to me!

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:51.040
Why did you bring the enemy here!?

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:55.630
They are here as Terran representatives who wish to request for this war's end!

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.140
You mustn't!

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.140
The legs...

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:08.730
Don't bother to die in this place! Get out of here!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.150
The gold one!

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:11.650
The SUMO Type?

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:14.030
Sochie, if you can hear me, please run!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.150
Sister?

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.240
Fire!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.450
This has gone too far!

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.620
Mr. Zenoa!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:40.930
If a nuclear weapon were to be used again for war...

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:44.560
...we'll only find ourselves... writing the Dark History's next chapter.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.060
What's going on?

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.030
Is that Lady Sochie?

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.150
Mr. Joseph?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.440
Tell me about it later.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.330
Why is it important for me to have escaped?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.160
It's all for the sake of protecting Dianna.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:10.120
Then why don't you attempt to take down Commander Phil?

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.330
As things are now, it's difficult to see who our enemies and allies are.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:16.960
Now that I've escaped from the Soleil posing as Dianna...

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.550
Dianna will now be treated as though she were Kihel.

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.050
So then...

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:24.430
...wouldn't Commander Phil simply just kill the real Dianna?

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:29.930
No, Commander Phil's unsure of which one's the true Dianna, so he'll just try stalling for time first.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.350
That's what I aimed for.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:34.230
I understand... we look so similar.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:37.150
Lieutenant Harry, we shall go the the Zacktraeger.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:40.360
What? Go to the Zacktraeger?

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:46.330
We must proceed before Miran and the others can start manipulating things, and once on the moon, we'll confirm Agrippa's true intentions.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:49.450
That is in fact a good idea... But...

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:53.120
Is the one on that shuttle truly Miss Kihel?

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:56.540
When I fled with her, she did seem to have Miss Kihel's scent.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.230
Guin and the others had mentioned something like this...

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:19.030
The Dark History truly began when a vast hellfire was created which consumed many lives on the earth.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:27.330
My understanding of the Mountain Cycle leads me to believe that mankind had once created some sort of super-weapon.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:33.160
In that case, the war with the Moonrace will be settled by whichever side can find these weapons first.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:35.830
A super weapon?

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.340
I now have this "super weapon."

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.050
But I cannot give it to either Dianna Counter, nor the Militia Soldiers.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.140
I alone am responsible for it.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:56.730
Well, I was ordered to observe activity around the Soleil's territory...

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:59.230
...And then I found you there.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:02.530
Hey, we're not nearly close enough for you to speak to me that way.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:06.030
If I hadn't been there to rescue you, you wouldn't be able to reprimand me like that.

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:08.240
Let's not talk about it.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:11.040
I wonder where Harry and Miss Dianna had gone off too...

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.660
I doubt they would simply disappear for their own enjoyment.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:14.960
Oh?

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.630
However you look at it, it looks more like they just ran away.

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.840
Ran away?

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.050
We can find out more after we've reunited with my unit.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:26.050
This is the place where I was supposed to meet with them.

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.350
Miss Fran Doll?

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:38.560
We're going to cross the ocean to the south of us?

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:43.440
Right. There is a place called Manuipich that was mentioned in the Royal Guard's transmission.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:48.240
That name... it's a place that was mentioned when they were discussing where to repair their ship, right?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:52.040
Correct. Lord Guin has also spoken to Chief Horace about this matter.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.160
What should we do?

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.750
We'll catch up with them.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.250
I'll go as well.

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.620
I still wish to speak with Miss Dianna.

00:21:58.620 --> 00:22:00.540
Well, About Dianna...

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:01.540
What is it?

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:05.260
l have been told that the Queen is under confinement due to an attempted mutiny.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:07.340
You managed to obtain enemy intel?

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:08.430
That is strange.

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:09.340
Strange?

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:12.350
I remember hearing her voice telling me to escape.

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:13.560
I heard it too.

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:17.440
Then the one who has been captured is...

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:19.350
That was my sister's voice!

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:42.230
<i>Dianna has been confined aboard the Soleil.</i>

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.230
<i>But Commander Phil remains confused when Kihel escaped and pretended to be Dianna.</i>

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:49.110
<i>Elsewhere, Lieutenant Poe believes....</i>

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:53.110
<i>...that she herself can become the Queen if Dianna was killed.</i>

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:55.830
<i>I now desire to protect both individuals.</i>

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:03.290
<i>Next Time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...
The Two Named Soriel

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:07.040
The wind creates two from one.

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>The Two Named Soriel</b>
